Dear Princess Celestia: An example letter.

Today I learned about greetings:
    I said "Hello, Equestria". P.S.This inline note is ignored.

Your faithful student, Twilight Sparkle.

PS This note is ignored by the interpreter.
PSS I said "This must not execute".
P.S. Dotted postscripts work too.
P.P.S.This spelling is in the language specification.
pss Lowercase works without final punctuation
